      * routed-expert projections: INT4, group size 128;
      * Mamba-2 mixer in_proj and out_proj: INT8 per output channel;
      * MTP draft head: routed experts INT4 (group 128); its attention, latent, shared-expert and eh projections
        INT8 (group 128);
      * embeddings, lm_head, attention, latent projections, shared experts, gates, conv1d, the vision tower and the
        vision projector stay BF16.
    The tensors are stored in the compressed-tensors pack-quantized format; model-summary-idxs.safetensors is part of
    that layout.
  - config.json: carries the quantization_config above.
  - README.md: replaced by this checkpoint's card. NVIDIA's card is NVIDIA-MODEL-CARD.md.
  - LICENSE, NOTICE, SHA256SUMS: added.
